          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>KPI Definitions</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Successful Orders: </run>
            <run fontsize='8'>Total number of orders successfully processed during the reported period. Success is from a customer perspective, not commission. Basis for successful is status from Backend (not 9C or Hurrier)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='cohorts_monthly_platform (cl_intl_markets)' name='federated.05ygp2a1a0hyle1g9af330fxb4w3' />
