            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Please note that not all sub-entities have Gross Profit / Fully Loaded Gross Profit available . Some Sub-entities have this data available only for specific delivery types. In this case it&apos;s recommended to do the cohort analysis by sub-entity or if it&apos;s the case by management entity group but not by the platform itself.

